<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 2.11 points off FTSE, July 14.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 2.11 points off FTSE, July 14.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will go ex-dividend on Monday, July 14 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 2.11 points off the index.</p>
<p>						 DIVIDEND   INDEX</p>
<p>						 (PENCE)    EFFECT</p>
<p>		 COMPANY			  Net	Net</p>
<p> * EMI Group				  22.00    0.550</p>
<p> * General Electric Co		     9.89    1.563</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5113</p>
</text>
